stume team and creating  all those looks took them a full four  months to pull off  all this done before their 14 weeks of  shooting in london  emma stone has a whopping 47 costume  changes and emma thompson follows close  behind with 33.  we can't forget the wigs though  especially since there were 240 used for  the movie  it makes sense that 37 people were on  hair and makeup teams for the two emmas  alone  seeing all that's gone into the creation  of this film makes us even more excited  for this legendary super villain to take  the screen  we're not sure what we're more excited  for though emma stone's performance or  her pup co-stars  which of corella's outfits is your  favorite
 

